---
// Stats / Philosophy callout section
---

<section class="w-full pt-28 pb-space-xl max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-margin md:px-margin-md lg:px-margin-lg">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-space-xl items-center scroll-reveal">

    <!-- Left copy -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-space-sm">
      <span class="font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest text-on-tertiary-container">The Biological Isthmus</span>
      <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-normal leading-tight">
        Where Two Oceans Converge Over Seven Fragile Corridors.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Right stats grid -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-space-md">
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-space-md rounded flex flex-col gap-1">
        <span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-normal">7%</span>
        <span class="font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary">Global Biodiversity</span>
        <p class="font-caption text-caption text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Central America houses 7% of planetary life within 0.1% of Earth's landmass.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-space-md rounded flex flex-col gap-1">
        <span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-normal">8 Max</span>
        <span class="font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary">Expedition Roster</span>
        <p class="font-caption text-caption text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Preserving intimate sanctuary quietude and strict low-impact trail presence.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-space-md rounded flex flex-col gap-1 col-span-2 sm:col-span-1">
        <span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-normal">100%</span>
        <span class="font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary">Regenerative Retain</span>
        <p class="font-caption text-caption text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Carbon offset by a factor of 1.4x into endemic cloud forest reforestation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
